OL,3,AAnthropic shares jump sharply with AI  
OL,4,Afirm's value close to $2tn at start of 
OL,5,Atrading                                
OL,7,FAI firm Anthropic is listed publicly   
OL,8,Ffor the first time on Thursday on the  
OL,9,FNasdaq stock market in New York        
OL,11,FTrading has begun, starting at roughly 
OL,12,F$110 per share, before sliding down    
OL,13,Fslightly, hovering around $100         
OL,15,FThat's a steep jump from the $83 set   
OL,16,Flast night - take a closer look at some
OL,17,Fof the numbers here                    
OL,19,FThe company behind AI product Claude   
OL,20,Fwas valued at $1.5tn (#1.14tn) after   
OL,21,Fraising a record $81bn ahead of its    
OL,22,Fstock market debut                     
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
